{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roleplay as a person in a fantasy world. <br>Your mental and physical resources are limited.<br> You need to get those resources\u00a0high enough to get through the challenges that your life brings.<br><br>On your way to greatness you will explore the Town and interact with various NPC-s.\u00a0 <br>Play mini-games that reward you with a lot of resources for just a few clicks.<br>And eventually... reach the quintillions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend resources to press buttons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/a4d442e3fe86a99fe257d75740d7431e.poster.avif?t=1768135088\" width=440 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/a4d442e3fe86a99fe257d75740d7431e.webm?t=1768135088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/a4d442e3fe86a99fe257d75740d7431e.mp4?t=1768135088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...to gain various returns: <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/aa542decf06273046711e03dc05f41b3.poster.avif?t=1768135088\" width=440 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/aa542decf06273046711e03dc05f41b3.webm?t=1768135088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/aa542decf06273046711e03dc05f41b3.mp4?t=1768135088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some resources are recovered when you start an new in-game day:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/41d851715577a0a19a6d375e1b894b8f.poster.avif?t=1768135088\" width=440 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/41d851715577a0a19a6d375e1b894b8f.webm?t=1768135088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/41d851715577a0a19a6d375e1b894b8f.mp4?t=1768135088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 5 days there is a challenge to overcome:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/extras/96ea01ce1bf4e70053468196494ffcc8.avif?t=1768135088\" width=440 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 routes through the challenges, each of which depends on different attributes and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is active and if you feel like you have to wait, you probably missed the right button to press.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976390?t=1768135088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976390?t=1768135088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/08549ee1ff8980b2b71cbc2e16127bf45223358f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768135088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976390/08549ee1ff8980b2b71cbc2e16127bf45223358f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768135088","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":